{"id":"sahbulaq-qifili-saray-kompleksi","qid":"Q720134","category":"site","type":"site","names":{"az":"Şahbulaq Qıfılı saray kompleksi","ru":"Тигранакерт","en":"Tigranakert of Artsakh"},"coordinates":[46.90583,40.06528],"coordinatesSource":"wd","region":"qarabag","regionSource":"wp-az-regions","admin":[{"qid":"Q201647","az":"Ağdam rayonu","en":"Aghdam"}],"firstRecord":{"year":601,"precision":"century","century":7,"bce":false,"kind":"first-mention","source":"wp-ru"},"period":"medieval","forms":[],"namedAfter":[],"etymology":[],"summary":{"az":{"text":"Şahbulaq Qıfılı saray kompleksi — Qarabağ xanlarının yay iqamətgahlarından biri. Ağdamın Şahbulaq yaylağında yerləşir.","truncated":false,"source":"wp-az"},"ru":{"text":"Тигранаке́рт (арм. Տիգրանակերտ, лат. Tigranocerta) — древний армянский город, расположенный в Агдамском районе Азербайджана. Город был частью провинции Арцах Великой Армении, с конца IV века — в Кавказской Албании, один из четырёх городов Великой Армении с таким названием, предположительно, основанный Тиграном II в I веке до н. э. и носивший его имя. Прямое упоминание об этом городе содержится в работе армянского историка VII века Себеоса; существует мнение, что на этот город указывал и Мовсес Каганкатваци.","truncated":true,"source":"wp-ru"},"en":{"text":"Tigranakert (Armenian: Արցախի Տիգրանակերտ, Arts'akhi Tigranakert), also known as Tigranakert-Artsakh, is a ruined Armenian city dating back to the Hellenistic period, located in the Aghdam District of what is today Azerbaijan.\nIt is one of several former cities in the Armenian plateau with the same name, named in honor of the Armenian king Tigranes the Great (r. 95–55 B.C.), with the name Artsakh referring to the historical province of Artsakh in the ancient Kingdom of Armenia.","truncated":true,"source":"wp-en"}},"images":[{"thumb":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/de/Tigranakert3.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","small":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/de/Tigranakert3.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","width":800,"height":600,"page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Tigranakert3.jpg","title":"Tigranakert3.jpg","artist":"Ліонкінг","credit":"Own work","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","source":"img-1"}],"sources":[{"id":"wd","kind":"wikidata","title":"Wikidata Q720134: Tigranakert of Artsakh","publisher":"Wikidata","url":"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q720134","licence":"CC0 1.0","retrieved":"2026-11-26"},{"id":"wp-az","kind":"wikipedia","lang":"az","title":"Şahbulaq Qıfılı saray kompleksi","publisher":"Vikipediya (azərbaycanca)","url":"https://az.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%C5%9Eahbulaq_Q%C4%B1f%C4%B1l%C4%B1_saray_kompleksi&oldid=9107501","pageUrl":"https://az.wikipedia.org/wiki/%C5%9Eahbulaq_Q%C4%B1f%C4%B1l%C4%B1_saray_kompleksi","revid":9107501,"revDate":"2026-09-15","licence":"CC BY-SA 4.0","retrieved":"2026-11-26"},{"id":"wp-ru","kind":"wikipedia","lang":"ru","title":"Тигранакерт (Арцах)","publisher":"Википедия (на русском)","url":"https://ru.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%D0%A2%D0%B8%D0%B3%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%B0%D0%BA%D0%B5%D1%80%D1%82_(%D0%90%D1%80%D1%86%D0%B0%D1%85)&oldid=153559203","pageUrl":"https://ru.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%A2%D0%B8%D0%B3%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%B0%D0%BA%D0%B5%D1%80%D1%82_(%D0%90%D1%80%D1%86%D0%B0%D1%85)","revid":153559203,"revDate":"2026-06-16","licence":"CC BY-SA 4.0","retrieved":"2026-11-26"},{"id":"wp-en","kind":"wikipedia","lang":"en","title":"Tigranakert of Artsakh","publisher":"Wikipedia (English)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Tigranakert_of_Artsakh&oldid=1364995684","pageUrl":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tigranakert_of_Artsakh","revid":1364995684,"revDate":"2026-07-19","licence":"CC BY-SA 4.0","retrieved":"2026-11-26"},{"id":"wp-az-regions","kind":"wikipedia","lang":"az","title":"Azərbaycanın iqtisadi rayonları","publisher":"Vikipediya (azərbaycanca)","url":"https://az.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Az%C9%99rbaycan%C4%B1n_iqtisadi_rayonlar%C4%B1&oldid=9209860","pageUrl":"https://az.wikipedia.org/wiki/Az%C9%99rbaycan%C4%B1n_iqtisadi_rayonlar%C4%B1","revid":9209860,"revDate":"2026-11-19","licence":"CC BY-SA 4.0","retrieved":"2026-11-26"},{"id":"img-1","kind":"commons","title":"File:Tigranakert3.jpg","publisher":"Wikimedia Commons","url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Tigranakert3.jpg","licence":"CC BY-SA 3.0","retrieved":"2026-11-26"}],"langs":["az","ru","en"],"verification":"review"}